    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Whenever the cleric casts a spell with a casting time of 1 standard action, he may instead cast it as a full round action. The cleric channels some of the energy of the spell into a defensive shield around him, giving him a deflection bonus to his AC equal to the level of the spell being cast. This bonus lasts until the beginning of the cleric's next turn.</p>",
